, "docstring": "Maps domain into window for a polynomial model which has these\nattributes.", "start_line": 283, "end_line": 307, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "__call__", "qualified_name": "__call__", "args": ["self", "model", "x", "y", "z", "weights", "rcond"], "decorators": ["fitter_unit_support"], "docstring": "Fit data to this model.\n\nParameters\n----------\nmodel : `~astropy.modeling.FittableModel`\n    model to fit to x, y, z\nx : array\n    input coordinates\ny : array\n    input coordinates\nz : array (optional)\n    input coordinates\nweights : array (optional)\n    weights\nrcond :  float, optional\n    Cut-off ", "start_line": 310, "end_line": 479, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "__init__", "qualified_name": "__init__", "args": ["self", "fitter", "outlier_func", "niter"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 501, "end_line": 505, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "__str__", "qualified_name": "__str__", "args": ["self"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 507, "end_line": 512, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "__repr__", "qualified_name": "__repr__", "args": ["self"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 514, "end_line": 520, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "__call__", "qualified_name": "__call__", "args": ["self", "model", "x", "y", "z", "weights"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Parameters\n----------\nmodel : `~astropy.modeling.FittableModel`\n    An analytic model which will be fit to the provided data.\n    This also contains the initial guess for an optimization\n    algorithm.\nx : array-like\n    Input coordinates.\ny : array-like\n    Data measurements (1D case) or input coor", "start_line": 522, "end_line": 571, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "__init__", "qualified_name": "__init__", "args": ["self"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 605, "end_line": 616, "is_async": false, "is_method": f