(a string of bits in a bytes object) to a\nboolean Numpy array.\n\nParameters\n----------\ndata : bytes\n    The bit array.  The most significant byte is read first.\n\nlength : int\n    The number of bits to read.  The least significant bits in the\n    data bytes beyond length will be i", "start_line": 75, "end_line": 104, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "bool_to_bitarray", "qualified_name": "bool_to_bitarray", "args": ["value"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Converts a numpy boolean array to a bit array (a string of bits in\na bytes object).\n\nParameters\n----------\nvalue : numpy bool array\n\nReturns\n-------\nbit_array : bytes\n    The first value in the input array will be the most\n    significant bit in the result.  The length will be `floor((N +\n    7) / 8", "start_line": 107, "end_line": 139, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "get_converter", "qualified_name": "get_converter", "args": ["field", "config", "pos"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Get an appropriate converter instance for a given field.\n\nParameters\n----------\nfield : astropy.io.votable.tree.Field\n\nconfig : dict, optional\n    Parser configuration dictionary\n\npos : tuple\n    Position in the input XML file.  Used for error messages.\n\nReturns\n-------\nconverter : astropy.io.votabl", "start_line": 1236, "end_line": 1294, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "_all_bytes", "qualified_name": "_all_bytes", "args": ["column"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 1314, "end_line": 1318, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "_all_unicode", "qualified_name": "_all_unicode", "args": ["column"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 1321, "end_line": 1325, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "_all_matching_dtype", "qualified_name": "_all_matching_dtype", "args": ["column"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 1328, "end_line": 1342, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "numpy_to_votable_dtype", "qualified_name": "numpy_to_votable_dtype", "args": ["dtype", "shape"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Converts a numpy dtype and shape to a dictionary of attributes for\na VOTable FIELD element and correspond to that type.\n\nParameters\n----------\ndtype : Numpy dtype instance\n\nshape : tuple\n\nReturns\n-------\nattributes : dict\n   A dict containing 'datatype' and 'arraysize' keys that can be\n   set on a V", "start_line": 1345, "end_line": 1378, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "table_column_to_votable_datatype", "qualified_name": "table_column_to_votable_datatype", "args": ["column"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Given a `astropy.table.Column` instance, returns the attributes\nnecessary to create a VOTable FIELD element that corresponds to\nthe type of the column.\n\nThis necessarily must perform some heuristics to determine the\ntype of variable length arrays fields, since they are not directly\nsupported by Nump", "start_line": 1381, "end_line": 1436, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "_ensure_bigendian", "qualified_name": "_ensure_bigendian", "args": ["x"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 48, "end_line": 51, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "_ensure_bigendian", "qualified_name": "_ensure_bigendian", "args": ["x"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 53, "end_line": 56, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "__init__", "qualified_name": "__init__", "args": ["self", "field", "config", "pos"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 162, "end_line": 163, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "_parse_length", "qualified_name": "_parse_length", "args": ["read"], "decorators": ["staticmethod"], "docstring": "", "start_line": 166, "end_line": 167, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "_write_length", "qualified_name": "_write_length", "args": ["length"], "decorators": ["staticmethod"], "docstring": "", "start_line": 170